OL,3,GNEWSASon jailed for murdering mum in
OL,4,A'ferocious' attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who killed his bed-bound mother
OL,7,Fin a "ferocious and sustained" hammer
OL,8,Fattack has been jailed for life and
OL,9,Ftold he will serve a minimum of 16
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FOn Friday, Michael Bowen, 35, was found
OL,13,Fguilty at Winchester Crown Court of the
OL,14,Fmurder of 65-year-old Janet Bowen at
OL,15,Ftheir home in Maple Gardens in Yateley,
OL,16,FHampshire, in the early hours of 31
OL,17,FDecember last year.
OL,19,FThe court heard he had hit his mother,
OL,20,Fwho had recently suffered a stroke,
OL,21,Fover the head and face with the hammer
OL,22,Fmore than 10 times.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
