OL,3,GNEWSASon jailed for murdering mum in
OL,4,A'ferocious' attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Adam Feest KC said it was
OL,7,F"impossible to imagine the terror that
OL,8,Fshe experienced in the final moments of
OL,9,Fher life".
